 each item\n\n1. **Chicken meal**:  \n   $1 \u00d7 $12 = **$12**\n\n2. **Milk**:  \n   5 packs \u00d7 $3 = **$15**\n\n3. **Apples**:  \n   4 \u00d7 $1.50 = **$6**\n\n4. **Pizza boxes**:  \n   Let the number of boxes be **x**  \n   So, cost = $8.50 \u00d7 x\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Add all the costs together\n\n$$\n\\text{Total cost} = 12 + 15 + 6 + 8.50x = 33 + 8.50x\n$$\n\nWe know the total cost is **$50**, so:\n\n$$\n33 + 8.50x = 50\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Solve for x\n\n$$\n8.50x = 50 - 33 = 17\n$$\n\n$$\nx = \\frac{17}{8.50} = 2\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{2}\n$$\n\nMarie ordered **2 boxes of pizza**.", "output_token_ids": [10061, 594, 1438, 1495, 279, 3491, 3019, 553, 3019, 382, 14374, 16246, 510, 12, 3070, 83863, 15145, 95518, 220, 16, 3745, 11, 400, 16, 17, 198, 12, 3070, 47, 7821, 315, 14074, 95518, 220, 20, 30306, 11, 400, 18, 1817, 198, 12, 3070, 2164, 642, 95518, 220, 19, 11, 400, 16, 13, 20, 15, 1817, 198, 12, 3070, 79749, 14697, 95518, 937, 14697, 11, 400, 23, 13, 20, 15, 1817, 198, 12, 3070, 7595, 3311, 7171, 95518, 400, 20, 15, 271, 44364, 14374, 14822, 220, 16, 25, 20517, 279, 2783, 315, 1817, 1509, 271, 16, 13, 3070, 83863, 15145, 95518, 2303, 256, 400, 16, 24768, 400, 16, 17, 284, 3070, 3, 16, 17, 56177, 17, 13, 3070, 44, 33163, 95518, 2303, 256, 220, 20, 30306, 24768, 400, 18, 284, 3070, 3, 16, 20, 56177, 18, 13, 3070, 2164, 642, 95518, 2303, 256, 220, 19, 24768, 400, 16, 13, 20, 15, 284, 3070, 3, 21, 56177, 19, 13, 3070, 79749, 14697, 95518, 2303, 256, 6771, 279, 1372, 315, 14697, 387, 3070, 87, 334, 2303, 256, 2055, 11, 2783, 284, 400, 23, 13, 20, 15, 24768, 856, 271, 44364, 14374, 14822, 220, 17, 25, 2691, 678, 279, 7049, 3786, 271, 14085, 198, 59, 1318, 90, 7595, 2783, 92, 284, 220, 16, 17, 488, 220, 16, 20, 488, 220, 21, 488, 220, 23, 13, 20, 15, 87, 284, 220, 18, 18, 488, 220, 23, 13, 20, 15, 87, 198, 14085, 271, 1654, 1414, 279, 2790, 2783, 374, 3070, 3, 20, 15, 97219, 773, 1447, 14085, 198, 18, 18, 488, 220, 23, 13